# Milestone 9 — every service's Dockerfile builds with the monorepo root as
# its context (`docker-compose.yml`'s `build.context: .`), since Maven's
# reactor needs the whole tree on disk to resolve `spendwise-common` via
# `-am`. This file keeps that context to source + POMs only, so the upload to
# the Docker daemon stays fast and a locally-built `target/` from an IDE run
# never leaks into a stage that runs its own `mvn clean package`.
.git
.gitignore
**/target/
**/*.iml
.idea/
*.log
.DS_Store
postman/
infra/
*.docx
